--- !u!114 &364371347
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 364371336}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3840d988a9df8ba4cb68dff3db09c4ca, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  <MoodImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 1809450015}
  <DialogueText>k__BackingField: {fileID: 1967412848}
  <NextButton>k__BackingField: {fileID: 26018829}
  <MumblingEmitter>k__BackingField: {fileID: 364371353}
  Dialogues:
  - <MoodImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 08ce53860c895df44a41ffd0acb6b62a, type: 3}
    <Text>k__BackingField: Whoa-oh! Oh dear, oh dear. You startled me.. Who are you?
      You're... wait, you're not a giant butterfly in disguise, are you?
    <CharacterTime>k__BackingField: 0.02
    <AutoSkip>k__BackingField: 0
    <AutoSkipTime>k__BackingField: 0
    <Skippable>k__BackingField: 1
  - <MoodImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ab543b9bb39c73f43aa9459459e1380a, type: 3}
    <Text>k__BackingField: ...
    <CharacterTime>k__BackingField: 0.5
    <AutoSkip>k__BackingField: 0
    <AutoSkipTime>k__BackingField: 0
    <Skippable>k__BackingField: 1
  - <MoodImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e89ce46372a2c4d4e8ccc395f33ba0ad, type: 3}
    <Text>k__BackingField: Oh, right! My intern! I'd almost forgotten. Come in! Steplightly
      now-this is no ordinary garden... This is a special place for our winged companions!
    <CharacterTime>k__BackingField: 0.02
    <AutoSkip>k__BackingField: 0
    <AutoSkipTime>k__BackingField: 0
    <Skippable>k__BackingField: 1
  - <MoodImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 08ce53860c895df44a41ffd0acb6b62a, type: 3}
    <Text>k__BackingField: Ah! Introductions, of course! Where are my manners? I
      am Professor Pup. E.Leon! Butterfly specialist, part-time gardener and friend
      to all that flutter!
    <CharacterTime>k__BackingField: 0.02
    <AutoSkip>k__BackingField: 0
    <AutoSkipTime>k__BackingField: 0
    <Skippable>k__BackingField: 1
  - <MoodImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 09396267c9f29a6409c78469eef04f0c, type: 3}
    <Text>k__BackingField: ' l''ve spent decades learning their ways, their favourite
      things, their little habits. '
    <CharacterTime>k__BackingField: 0.02
    <AutoSkip>k__BackingField: 0
    <AutoSkipTime>k__BackingField: 0
    <Skippable>k__BackingField: 1
  - <MoodImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e89ce46372a2c4d4e8ccc395f33ba0ad, type: 3}
    <Text>k__BackingField: This is were you come in, my dear intern! You'll be helping
      me with crucial butterfly matters -feeding, documenting, conversing with them,
      though I must admit they're terrible listeners, hoho.
    <CharacterTime>k__BackingField: 0.02
    <AutoSkip>k__BackingField: 0
    <AutoSkipTime>k__BackingField: 0
    <Skippable>k__BackingField: 1
  - <MoodImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e89ce46372a2c4d4e8ccc395f33ba0ad, type: 3}
    <Text>k__BackingField: ' Our job is to keep their home blooming and buzzing!
      You shall assist me in this botanical adventure'
    <CharacterTime>k__BackingField: 0.02
    <AutoSkip>k__BackingField: 0
    <AutoSkipTime>k__BackingField: 0
    <Skippable>k__BackingField: 1
  - <MoodImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 09396267c9f29a6409c78469eef04f0c, type: 3}
    <Text>k__BackingField: Select a flower you'd like to plant by clicking on the
      notes up there...
    <CharacterTime>k__BackingField: 0.02
    <AutoSkip>k__BackingField: 0
    <AutoSkipTime>k__BackingField: 0
    <Skippable>k__BackingField: 1
  - <MoodImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 09396267c9f29a6409c78469eef04f0c, type: 3}
    <Text>k__BackingField: ' Now simply drag them onto the floor and drop them where
      you want to plant them!'
    <CharacterTime>k__BackingField: 0.02
    <AutoSkip>k__BackingField: 0
    <AutoSkipTime>k__BackingField: 0
    <Skippable>k__BackingField: 1
  - <MoodImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e89ce46372a2c4d4e8ccc395f33ba0ad, type: 3}
    <Text>k__BackingField: "Well, now isn\u2018t that lovely?!"
    <CharacterTime>k__BackingField: 0.02
    <AutoSkip>k__BackingField: 0
    <AutoSkipTime>k__BackingField: 0
    <Skippable>k__BackingField: 1
  - <MoodImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e89ce46372a2c4d4e8ccc395f33ba0ad, type: 3}
    <Text>k__BackingField: Now, now! Planting is not just about tossing flowers into
      the soil and hoping for the best! No.
    <CharacterTime>k__BackingField: 0.02
    <AutoSkip>k__BackingField: 0
    <AutoSkipTime>k__BackingField: 0
    <Skippable>k__BackingField: 1
  - <MoodImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e89ce46372a2c4d4e8ccc395f33ba0ad, type: 3}
    <Text>k__BackingField: Every choice we make has an effect on our fluttering friends.
      One small action leads to big consequences!
    <CharacterTime>k__BackingField: 0.02
    <AutoSkip>k__BackingField: 0
    <AutoSkipTime>k__BackingField: 0
    <Skippable>k__BackingField: 1
  - <MoodImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ab543b9bb39c73f43aa9459459e1380a, type: 3}
    <Text>k__BackingField: "Some plants thrive together. Others\u2026 well, let\u2019s
      just say they don\u2019t quite get along.  "
    <CharacterTime>k__BackingField: 0.02
    <AutoSkip>k__BackingField: 0
    <AutoSkipTime>k__BackingField: 0
    <Skippable>k__BackingField: 1
  - <MoodImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e89ce46372a2c4d4e8ccc395f33ba0ad, type: 3}
    <Text>k__BackingField: "A single misplaced plant can affect your entire population.
      Some might say that\u2019s just the universe flexing its...butterfly effect."
    <CharacterTime>k__BackingField: 0.02
    <AutoSkip>k__BackingField: 0
    <AutoSkipTime>k__BackingField: 0
    <Skippable>k__BackingField: 1
  - <MoodImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e89ce46372a2c4d4e8ccc395f33ba0ad, type: 3}
    <Text>k__BackingField: "Oh! And if you plant the wrong one, well\u2026 there\u2019s
      no tearing it out. Oh no, no, no. We do not rip plants from the earth here! 
      If something is out of place, we wait until it fades on its own! "
    <CharacterTime>k__BackingField: 0.02
    <AutoSkip>k__BackingField: 0
    <AutoSkipTime>k__BackingField: 0
    <Skippable>k__BackingField: 1
  - <MoodImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e89ce46372a2c4d4e8ccc395f33ba0ad, type: 3}
    <Text>k__BackingField: Now, let's see who'll visit us!
    <CharacterTime>k__BackingField: 0.02
    <AutoSkip>k__BackingField: 0
    <AutoSkipTime>k__BackingField: 0
    <Skippable>k__BackingField: 1
  - <MoodImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e89ce46372a2c4d4e8ccc395f33ba0ad, type: 3}
    <Text>k__BackingField: 
    <CharacterTime>k__BackingField: 0.02
    <AutoSkip>k__BackingField: 0
    <AutoSkipTime>k__BackingField: 0
    <Skippable>k__BackingField: 1
  ButterflyDataA: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 93349b1d8c9e78f48a0cdd5ba920ff23, type: 2}
  SpawnSingleButterflyA:
  - <MoodImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 09396267c9f29a6409c78469eef04f0c, type: 3}
    <Text>k__BackingField: "Ah-ha! A Moonsilk has arrived! Royalty has graced your
      garden\u2014better roll out the red carpet..or..uh..blue..?"
    <CharacterTime>k__BackingField: 0.02
    <AutoSkip>k__BackingField: 0
    <AutoSkipTime>k__BackingField: 0
    <Skippable>k__BackingField: 0
  - <MoodImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 09396267c9f29a6409c78469eef04f0c, type: 3}
    <Text>k__BackingField: Observe the elegance! This specimen is practically woven
      from moonlight!
    <CharacterTime>k__BackingField: 0.02
    <AutoSkip>k__BackingField: 0
    <AutoSkipTime>k__BackingField: 0
    <Skippable>k__BackingField: 0
  - <MoodImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 09396267c9f29a6409c78469eef04f0c, type: 3}
    <Text>k__BackingField: Oh! Look! A Moonsilk! Move careful now, they tend to be
      quite shy!
    <CharacterTime>k__BackingField: 0.02
    <AutoSkip>k__BackingField: 0
    <AutoSkipTime>k__BackingField: 0
    <Skippable>k__BackingField: 0
  ButterflyDataB: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2c29a11cbbb3d8a4a959e65ac9850b63, type: 2}
  SpawnSingleButterflyB:
  - <MoodImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 09396267c9f29a6409c78469eef04f0c, type: 3}
    <Text>k__BackingField: "Oh-ho! Look what the wind\u2019s swept in\u2014an absolute
      firecracker of a flutterer!"
    <CharacterTime>k__BackingField: 0.02
    <AutoSkip>k__BackingField: 0
    <AutoSkipTime>k__BackingField: 0
    <Skippable>k__BackingField: 0
  - <MoodImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 09396267c9f29a6409c78469eef04f0c, type: 3}
    <Text>k__BackingField: "A butterfly so bold, the flowers are likely whispering,
      \u2018Good heavens, who let this show-off in?!"
    <CharacterTime>k__BackingField: 0.02
    <AutoSkip>k__BackingField: 0
    <AutoSkipTime>k__BackingField: 0
    <Skippable>k__BackingField: 0
  - <MoodImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 09396267c9f29a6409c78469eef04f0c, type: 3}
    <Text>k__BackingField: "A brilliant red, a fearless spirit\u2014oh, I do like
      this one!"
    <CharacterTime>k__BackingField: 0.02
    <AutoSkip>k__BackingField: 0
    <AutoSkipTime>k__BackingField: 0
    <Skippable>k__BackingField: 0
  ButterflyDataC: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f88d434c639803c478fe28c0048efc22, type: 2}
  SpawnSingleButterflyC:
  - <MoodImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 09396267c9f29a6409c78469eef04f0c, type: 3}
    <Text>k__BackingField: "Ah-ha! Mosswing! A fine example of nature\u2019s own
      subtlety. A creature so in tune with its surroundings, one might mistake it
      for a leaf upon the breeze! Clever little things!"
    <CharacterTime>k__BackingField: 0.02
    <AutoSkip>k__BackingField: 0
    <AutoSkipTime>k__BackingField: 0
    <Skippable>k__BackingField: 0
  - <MoodImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 09396267c9f29a6409c78469eef04f0c, type: 3}
    <Text>k__BackingField: "Ah! A butterfly so perfectly in tune with nature, even
      the plants must be wondering if they\u2019re distant cousins!\""
    <CharacterTime>k__BackingField: 0.02
    <AutoSkip>k__BackingField: 0
    <AutoSkipTime>k__BackingField: 0
    <Skippable>k__BackingField: 0
  - <MoodImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 09396267c9f29a6409c78469eef04f0c, type: 3}
    <Text>k__BackingField: "I do say, nature has outdone itself\u2014this little
      fellow could waltz past a crowd of botanists and not raise an eyebrow!"
    <CharacterTime>k__BackingField: 0.02
    <AutoSkip>k__BackingField: 0
    <AutoSkipTime>k__BackingField: 0
    <Skippable>k__BackingField: 0
  SpawnMulti:
  - <MoodImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e89ce46372a2c4d4e8ccc395f33ba0ad, type: 3}
    <Text>k__BackingField: "Ohhh, look at that! Those little fellows really seem
      to like this! They have sent out a group text to their friends\u2014this place
      is trending! Hehe!"
    <CharacterTime>k__BackingField: 0.02
    <AutoSkip>k__BackingField: 0
    <AutoSkipTime>k__BackingField: 0
    <Skippable>k__BackingField: 0
  - <MoodImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e89ce46372a2c4d4e8ccc395f33ba0ad, type: 3}
    <Text>k__BackingField: "You genius! Our fluttering friends adore this stuff.
      You basically opened a butterfly caf\xE9!"
    <CharacterTime>k__BackingField: 0.02
    <AutoSkip>k__BackingField: 0
    <AutoSkipTime>k__BackingField: 0
    <Skippable>k__BackingField: 0
  - <MoodImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e89ce46372a2c4d4e8ccc395f33ba0ad, type: 3}
    <Text>k__BackingField: "Oh dear; look at that! Nature is working its magic! They
      can\u2018t get enough, heh!"
    <CharacterTime>k__BackingField: 0.02
    <AutoSkip>k__BackingField: 0
    <AutoSkipTime>k__BackingField: 0
    <Skippable>k__BackingField: 0
  - <MoodImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e89ce46372a2c4d4e8ccc395f33ba0ad, type: 3}
    <Text>k__BackingField: You did it! Some butterflies were hesitant, but with the
      right flowers, they're throwing a garden party!
    <CharacterTime>k__BackingField: 0.02
    <AutoSkip>k__BackingField: 0
    <AutoSkipTime>k__BackingField: 0
    <Skippable>k__BackingField: 0
  PlantDie:
  - <MoodImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6aa1fe816baf78c4aa30024fe44b835b, type: 3}
    <Text>k__BackingField: "Hmmm\u2026 the butterflies seem confused\u2026"
    <CharacterTime>k__BackingField: 0.02
    <AutoSkip>k__BackingField: 0
    <AutoSkipTime>k__BackingField: 0
    <Skippable>k__BackingField: 0
  - <MoodImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6aa1fe816baf78c4aa30024fe44b835b, type: 3}
    <Text>k__BackingField: "Yikes. That combo of plants isn\u2019t working\u2014it\u2019s
      like inviting cats to a dog park!"
    <CharacterTime>k__BackingField: 0.02
    <AutoSkip>k__BackingField: 0
    <AutoSkipTime>k__BackingField: 0
    <Skippable>k__BackingField: 0
  - <MoodImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6aa1fe816baf78c4aa30024fe44b835b, type: 3}
    <Text>k__BackingField: "Oh dear, my. Something seems to be wrong\u2026"
    <CharacterTime>k__BackingField: 0.02
    <AutoSkip>k__BackingField: 0
    <AutoSkipTime>k__BackingField: 0
    <Skippable>k__BackingField: 0
  - <MoodImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6aa1fe816baf78c4aa30024fe44b835b, type: 3}
    <Text>k__BackingField: "Oh dear, the butterflies are leaving\u2026"
    <CharacterTime>k__BackingField: 0.02
    <AutoSkip>k__BackingField: 0
    <AutoSkipTime>k__BackingField: 0
    <Skippable>k__BackingField: 0
  DialogueChance: 0.25
